      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a backgrounder about the recent student loan relief moves. Can you give me a breakdown of the main arguments for and against it? Also, I need to know which side's concerns are actually grounded in substantive legal or economic arguments and which ones are more just political posturing. Thanks.",
